WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.200
Okay,

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.933
a number series!

00:00:09.933 --> 00:00:10.533
Two,

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:11.133
four,

00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:11.700
eight,

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.300
sixteen,

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.467
and then...

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:15.233
what comes next?

00:00:15.233 --> 00:00:15.800
A.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:16.400
Twenty-four,

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.000
B.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.567
Twenty,

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:18.167
C.

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:18.733
Thirty-two,

00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:19.933
or D.

00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:20.500
Thirty?

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.667
Five seconds!

00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:28.667
TIME'S UP!

00:00:29.333 --> 00:00:31.000
The answer is...

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:31.567
C,

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:32.100
thirty-two!

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.767
Each number doubles:

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:34.333
two,

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:34.900
four,

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:35.467
eight,

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:36.000
sixteen,

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.333
so the next is sixteen times

00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:41.000
two is thirty-two.

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:42.567
So,

00:00:42.567 --> 00:00:44.600
are you smart or fart?

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:47.033
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:48.233
find your rank!

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:49.733
So,

00:00:49.733 --> 00:00:51.133
how did you do?

00:00:51.133 --> 00:00:52.500
Comment your score below,

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:53.867
and follow for more!
